(You are a Junior Operations Analyst at the Airport Operations Control Centre \(AOCC\),) Tj T*
(Kempegowda International Airport Bengaluru \(BIAL / BLR\).) Tj T*
T*
(The Airport Director has requested an operational performance review for 50 scheduled) Tj T*
(commercial flights operated across Terminal 1 and Terminal 2.) Tj T*
T*
(Your objective is to provide actionable intelligence regarding:) Tj T*
(1. Passenger distribution across airlines and terminals) Tj T*
(2. Carrier on-time punctuality rates \(OTP\)) Tj T*
(3. Root-cause turnaround delay bottlenecks) Tj T*
(4. Peak baggage handling demands across departure waves) Tj T*
T*
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 8.2 Tf
0.07 0.20 0.38 rg
(2. DATASET SUMMARY \(50 Flights, 13 Columns\)) Tj T*
/F3 8.2 Tf
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F3 8.2 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(Col A: Flight_ID       - Callsign/Tracking ID \(FL-101 to FL-150\)) Tj T*
(Col B: Airline         - IndiGo, Air India, Akasa Air, Vistara, SpiceJet) Tj T*
(Col C: Terminal        - T1 \(Low-Cost Domestic\), T2 \(Full-Service & International\)) Tj T*
(Col D: Sector          - Route \(BLR-DEL, BLR-BOM, BLR-LHR, BLR-SFO, etc.\)) Tj T*
(Col E: Aircraft_Type   - A320neo, A321neo, B737-MAX8, B777-300ER, B787-8, ATR-72) Tj T*
(Col F: Flight_Type     - Domestic vs International) Tj T*
(Col G: Time_Slot       - Morning, Afternoon, Evening, Night) Tj T*
(Col H: Pax_Capacity    - Total passenger seats installed \(72 to 342\)) Tj T*
(Col I: Pax_Booked      - Actual passengers boarded \(68 to 335\)) Tj T*
(Col J: Baggage_Pcs     - Checked-in baggage count \(75 to 620\)) Tj T*
(Col K: Status          - On-Time, Delayed, Cancelled) Tj T*
(Col L: Delay_Mins      - Turnaround delay duration in minutes \(0 for On-Time\)) Tj T*
(Col M: Delay_Reason    - None, Late Inbound, ATC Congestion, Snag, Weather, etc.) Tj T*
T*
0.60 0.65 0.75 rg
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
