(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
/F4 8.2 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(STEP 1: IMPORT CSV INTO GOOGLE SHEETS \(MANDATORY\)) Tj T*
/F3 8.2 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(1. Open browser -> Go to https://sheets.new \(opens a new blank sheet\).) Tj T*
(2. Go to top menu: File -> Import.) Tj T*
(3. Click the "Upload" tab on the right.) Tj T*
(4. Drag and drop "05_Aviation_BLR_Airport_Pivot_Master_Dataset.csv" \(or Browse\).) Tj T*
(5. In the Import Location dialog:) Tj T*
(   - Import location: "Replace current sheet") Tj T*
(   - Separator type: "Detect automatically") Tj T*
(   - Convert text to numbers, dates, and formulas: Check "Yes") Tj T*
(6. Click "Import data".) Tj T*
(7. Rename bottom-left sheet tab to "Raw_Data".) Tj T*
(8. Name spreadsheet at top left: [RollNo]_[YourName]_Aviation_Pivot_Lab.) Tj T*
T*
/F4 8.2 Tf
0.10 0.35 0.65 rg
(STEP 2: CREATE PIVOT TABLES & CHARTS) Tj T*
/F3 8.2 Tf
0.15 0.18 0.22 rg
(1. Click cell A1 -> Press Ctrl + A to select all data.) Tj T*
(2. Top menu: Insert -> Pivot table -> Select "New sheet" -> Click "Create".) Tj T*
(3. Rename tab to "Task1_Pax_Terminal".) Tj T*
(4. In the Pivot Table Editor sidebar on the right:) Tj T*
(   - Rows: Click "Add" -> select field.) Tj T*
(   - Columns: Click "Add" -> select field.) Tj T*
(   - Values: Click "Add" -> select field -> choose Summarize by \(SUM, COUNTA, AVERAGE\).) Tj T*
(   - Filters: Click "Add" -> select field.) Tj T*
(5. Show as Percentage of Row \(Task 2\):) Tj T*
(   In Values section -> change "Show as" from Default to "% of row".) Tj T*
(6. Insert Charts:) Tj T*
(   Highlight the Pivot Table range -> Insert -> Chart.) Tj T*
(   In Chart Editor \(Setup tab\): Choose Chart Type \(Column, 100% Stacked Bar, Bar, Combo\).) Tj T*
(   In Chart Editor \(Customize tab\): Add Chart Titles, Legend, and Data Labels.) Tj T*
T*
